<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR WELLNESS COMPANION</view><view class="title">您好，{{user.display_name||'居民'}}。</view><view class="desc">今天也从一份简单的记录开始。</view>
<view class="summary" wx:if="{{resident}}"><view style="font-size:25rpx;color:#c8e8da">我的健康档案</view><view style="font-size:42rpx;font-weight:700;margin-top:5rpx">{{resident.name}}</view><view class="desc">出生年份 {{resident.birth_year}} · 日常健康管理</view><view class="line" style="background:#37695d"></view><view style="font-size:24rpx">社区服务授权：{{resident.consent_active?'有效':'已撤回'}}</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{!resident}}" class="notice">您还没有健康档案。填写基本信息并完成知情同意后，即可开始记录。</view>
<button wx:if="{{!resident}}" class="btn primary" bindtap="goProfile">创建我的健康档案</button>
<view class="section-title">常用服务</view><view class="grid-2"><view class="tile" bindtap="goVitals"><view class="tile-icon">♡</view><view class="tile-title">健康数据</view><view class="tile-sub">血压 / 血糖 / 体重</view></view><view class="tile" bindtap="goQuestionnaires"><view class="tile-icon">▤</view><view class="tile-title">自主问卷</view><view class="tile-sub">健康习惯 / 心情记录</view></view><view class="tile" bindtap="goReminders"><view class="tile-icon">◷</view><view class="tile-title">健康提醒</view><view class="tile-sub">日程 / 待办事项</view></view><view class="tile" bindtap="goFamily"><view class="tile-icon">♧</view><view class="tile-title">家庭共享</view><view class="tile-sub">主动授权 / 随时撤回</view></view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="card-title">个人资料与授权</view><text style="color:#26715d" bindtap="goProfile">查看 ›</text></view><view class="desc">社区工作人员仅能在有效授权下查看居民档案；家属只能访问您明确共享的内容。</view></view>
<view class="hint">提醒与问卷用于日常健康管理，不替代医生诊断；无自动医疗风险判断。</view><button class="btn" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button></view>
